# Arc's icon set, redrawn around Cra's C by Provok (mat-up/cra-icons): each of the nine is in the Icon tab's
# list and its picture ships in the app. Picking one puts it on Cra.app ("put on the app" needs the bundled
# PNG; an id the list doesn't know is ignored and logs nothing). appIcon= picks without remembering, so the
# run never writes the defaults the installed Cra reads, and it ends on Segments: the build is left as it was.
home
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
cra://debug?appIcon=original
expect-log app icon: original put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=candy
expect-log app icon: candy put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=hologram
expect-log app icon: hologram put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=neon
expect-log app icon: neon put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=fluted-glass
expect-log app icon: fluted-glass put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=schoolbook
expect-log app icon: schoolbook put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=colorful
expect-log app icon: colorful put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=canary
expect-log app icon: canary put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=early-birds
expect-log app icon: early-birds put on the app
cra://debug?appIcon=segments
expect-log app icon: segments taken off the app
cra://debug?bundleIcon=end
expect-log bundle icon end: custom=0 file=0
